36
00:04:21,963 --> 00:04:27,100
[Host] It means collecting or recruiting — asking many people to send in ideas.

37
00:04:27,699 --> 00:04:34,708
[Slow] 名前は、9月に、お客さんの投票で決まります。

38
00:04:35,507 --> 00:04:39,156
[Host] The names will be decided in September by a visitor vote.

39
00:04:39,755 --> 00:04:42,108
